 and Quantity, High School — Algebra, High School — Functions, High School — Geometry, High School — Statistics and Probability。\n\n## 怎么查\n\n编号已知时直接按编号取行（编号在第一列，行首匹配最准）：\n\n```bash\ngrep -m1 '^8.G.7,' references/standards.csv\n```\n\n按年级或领域筛选，只看编号和要求两列：\n\n```bash\nawk -F',' '$2==\"5\"' references/standards.csv | cut -d',' -f1,5\ngrep ',Geometry,' references/standards.csv | cut -d',' -f1,5\n```\n\n按关键词找（例如勾股定理相关）：\n\n```bash\ngrep -i 'pythagorean' references/standards.csv | cut -d',' -f1,2,5\n```\n\n`requirement` 字段里含逗号，所以取整行文本时用 `grep` 原样输出，别用 `cut` 切到第 5 列以后。\n\n## 回答约定\n\n- 引用课标要求时给出**原文**（英文）加编号，必要时再翻译。\n- 一并给出 `grade` / `domain` 和 `pdf_page`，方便回到 PDF 核对。\n- 表里没有的条目直说没有，不要照编号规律臆造。\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1788754938955},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I need to look at the standards for 8th grade. Let me first check the index to see what domains are covered in grade 8, and then search for the specific standards matching each topic.\n\nTopics:\n1. 解一元一次方程 - likely 8.EE.7 (solving linear equations in one variable)\n2. 一次函数图像与斜率 - likely 8.EE.5, 8.EE.6 (graphing proportional relationships, slope), 8.F\n3. 勾股定理求边长 - 8.G.7\n4. 散点图与趋势线 - 8.SP.1, 8.SP.2, 8.SP.3\n5. 平方根估算 - 8.NS.1, 8.NS.2, 8.EE.2\n\nLet me query the CSV. First, look at the index for grade 8, then grep for relevant keywords.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_69253671118d4cfa8d7939b0","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /Users/l/other_git_repos/calculus-quest/nodejs_react_lib/learn-claude-code/custom_skill_space/math-standards && cat references/index.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_cffe5f70637b4789b758da65","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /Users/l/other_git_repos/calculus-quest/nodejs_react_lib/learn-claude-code/custom_skill_space/math-standards && grep '^8\\.' references/standards.csv | cut -d',' -f1"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"ark-plan","model":"glm-5.3","usage":{"input":715,"output":304,"cacheRead":2304,"ca